  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 2308.10 Vessel Agent Fees",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 2308.10 Vessel Agent Fees.\n\n(a) In addition to the fees set forth in Saf-C 2302.04, each vessel agent may charge the following fees:\n\n(1) Pursuant to RSA 270-E:5, II, $5.00 per registration decal;\n\n(2) Pursuant to RSA 72-A:4, III, $1 per boat; and\n\n(3) Pursuant to RSA 270-E:5-a, II(e), $3.00 per boat fee decal.\n\nSource. #5283, eff 11-22-91; ss by #6616, eff 10-25-97, EXPIRED: 10-25-05\n\nNew. #8506, INTERIM, eff 12-7-05, EXPIRES: 6-5-06; ss and moved by #8617, eff 4-28-06, (from Saf-C 2308.08) EXPIRED: 1-21-15 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 2300)\n\nNew. #10787, eff 2-20-15; ss by #14321, eff 7-16-25, EXPIRES: 7-16-35",
